        {
          "text": "Amadodana kaShemu ayengoElamu loAshuri loArpakishadi loLudi loAramu. Amadodana kaAramu ayengoUzi loHuli loGetheri loMesheki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.1.17",
